# Antidote bottle — a tall-neck apothecary vial, greyscale so the vanilla potion
# layer system tints it per cure (SPEC §6, DESIGN §3). Distinct from vanilla's
# round-bottomed potion bottle: a slender corked neck over a narrow tapered body.
# Light from the upper-left; the interior liquid ramps glass -> ash -> smoke.
size: 16
kind: sprite
ships: src/main/resources/assets/distillation/textures/item/antidote.png

legend:
  . transparent
  k ink                 # outline / stays dark under a multiply tint
  o smoke               # cork stopper
  h bone                # glass highlight / shine
  n ash                 # glass midtone
  l distillation.glass  # liquid, light
  m ash                 # liquid, midtone
  d smoke               # liquid, core shadow

